00:30:37.950 --> 00:30:39.540
the things we're interested in predicting,

00:30:39.540 --> 00:30:41.580
they're not isolated systems, right?

00:30:41.580 --> 00:30:42.870
What happens in their future,

00:30:42.870 --> 00:30:45.210
it always lies in the intersection

00:30:45.210 --> 00:30:48.245
